.TH CHTTPSVR_CONSTRUCT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_construct \- declare and initialize a chttpsvr handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chttpserver.h>

chttpsvr_construct(name, cl);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Declares a chttpsvr variable with the name name.  It then calls
ccol_create_chttpsvr(cl) and assigns the result to that variable.  On
a failure it calls ccol_fatal_err() and does not return.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     The identifier for the new handle variable.
cl       The parent logger to derive the logger of this server from.
         Pass CLOG_INVALID to use an internal logger that writes only
         FATAL messages to stderr.  See ccol_create_chttpsvr_mp for
         the details.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_construct_scoped (3),
.BR chttpsvr_declare (3),
.BR ccol_create_chttpsvr (3)
